on","name":"topic:animation","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-08-17T22:56:41Z","updated_at":"2025-09-29T17:51:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6] and v4.5.beta5.official [c81fd6c51]\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - v4.4.1.stable + v4.5.beta5\n\n### Issue description\n\nAnimationPlayer cannot set properties defined as typed Dictionaries in an exported project.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create an exported typed Dictionary.\n```gdscript\n@export var dict: Dictionary[String,bool]={\n\t\"string1\":false,\n\t\"string2\":false,\n\t\"string3\":false\n}\n```\n\n2. Add a live representation of this data to see changes.\n```gdscript\nfunc _process(delta: float) -> void:\n\t$RichTextLabel.text = str(dict)\n```\n3. Create an AnimationPlayer node with an animation which alters the `dict` value throughout.\n\nWhen the project is played in the editor, the value changes according to the animation as expected.\n`dict` remains unchanged during the animation when the project is run after being exported.\nThis affects Web and Windows Executable exports using the default template. I have not tested others.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[4.4.1env2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21824834/4.4.1env2.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109712/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109712/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}